; Ledgeline projection
; projection: Parity comments
; created: 2026-10-29
; updated: 2026-10-29
; cash: assets:checking

; Plan 31: a scenario file as a person writes one. `;;;;` section headings,
; notes, a comment attached to the rule below it, comments inside blocks,
; commented-out (disabled) entries, a `comment` block and a step pair. hledger
; reads every disabled entry as the comment it is, and so must Ledgeline.

;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;; Income

; Salary, paid on the last working day.
~ monthly  salary  ; employer: acme
    revenues:salary      $-6000.00  ; owner: alex
    assets:checking

; The "with" alternative: a big new customer, turned off.
; ~ monthly from 2027-01-01  bonus contract
;     revenues:bonus      $-4000.00
;     assets:checking

;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;; Operational expenses

~ monthly  rent
    ; the lease runs to 2028
    expenses:rent         $2000.00
    assets:checking

; A STEP: payroll jumps in February.
~ monthly to 2027-02-01  payroll
    expenses:payroll      $5000.00  ; line: payroll
    assets:checking

~ monthly from 2027-02-01  payroll
    expenses:payroll      $8000.00  ; line: payroll
    assets:checking

; ~ 2027-03-01  legal fees, maybe
